// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
inherit NPC;
int accept_object(object me, object ob);

void create()
{
        set_name("渔夫", ({ "yu fu" }) );
        set("gender", "男性" );
        set("age", 22);
        create_family("侠客岛", 2, "弟子");
        setup();
}
int accept_object(object me, object ob)
{
        object ling1;
        object ling2;

        return 1;

        ling1=new("/d/xiakedao/obj/tongpai1");
        ling1->set_temp("own", (string)me->query("name"));
        ling1->move(me);
        message_vision("渔夫给$N一块铜铸令牌。\n", me);

        ling2=new("/d/xiakedao/obj/tongpai2");
        ling2->set_temp("own", (string)me->query("name"));
        ling2->move(me);
        message_vision("渔夫给$N一块铜铸令牌。\n", me);

        return 1;
}
